    "\n",
    "**Core concept Vibe:** A percentage means a number out of 100.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Build Buddy action:** Convert 10 percentage points to a fraction and calculate the discount amount.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Expected checkpoint:** Discount fraction = 0.1; discount amount = INR 45.00.\n"
